      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Let's talk about the absolute foundation of every guy's wardrobe: a really good shirt. A great men's shirt isn't just a piece of fabric you throw on in a hurry; it dictates your entire vibe for the day. Whether you are stepping into a crucial meeting, grabbing weekend brunch, or heading out for a date, the right shirt instantly makes you look put-together. But here is the problemâ€”most traditional shirts are stiff, scratchy, and practically trap heat.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
