      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Linen is honestly nature's greatest invention for warm weather. It is incredibly lightweight and dries out almost instantly. Yes, it has a natural tendency to wrinkle slightly, but that texture is exactly what gives a linen shirt its premium, relaxed character.",
      "protectedControls": []
