      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Take a solid blue or white structured cotton shirt and tuck it into a pair of dark Men's Pants. Roll the sleeves up twice, exposing your forearm. Add a decent watch and some leather loafers. You look like the boss, but you feel completely relaxed.",
      "protectedControls": []
