      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00076",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[76]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 6176,
      "endIndex": 6177,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00077",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[77]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 6177,
      "endIndex": 6232,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "1. Can I wear a casual cotton shirt to a formal event?",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00078",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[78]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 6232,
      "endIndex": 6504,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "It depends on the shirt and the event. A crisp, perfectly ironed, solid-colored cotton shirt (like white or light blue) tucked into tailored chinos works beautifully for smart-casual and semi-formal events. However, leave the bold prints and half-sleeves for the weekend.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00079",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[79]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 6504,
      "endIndex": 6505,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00080",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[80]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 6505,
      "endIndex": 6551,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "2. Should I tuck my shirt in or leave it out?",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00081",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[81]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 6551,
      "endIndex": 6868,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "As a general rule, if the hem of the shirt is flat, it is meant to be worn untucked. If the hem is curved (longer in the front and back, shorter on the sides), it is traditionally designed to be tucked in. However, our casual shirts feature a perfectly balanced hem length so you can comfortably wear them both ways.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00082",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[82]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 6868,
      "endIndex": 6869,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00083",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[83]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 6869,
      "endIndex": 6904,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "3. Does 100% linen wrinkle easily?",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00084",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[84]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 6904,
      "endIndex": 7151,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Yes, pure linen will naturally crease as you wear it. That is a hallmark of the premium fabric, not a flaw! It provides a relaxed, sophisticated charm. If you want a crisper look for the office, a quick run over with a steam iron works perfectly.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00085",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[85]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 7151,
      "endIndex": 7152,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00086",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[86]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 7152,
      "endIndex": 7185,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "4. How should a men's shirt fit?",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00087",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[87]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 7185,
      "endIndex": 7492,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "The shoulder seams should sit exactly at the edge of your shoulders. You should be able to fit two fingers comfortably between your neck and the buttoned collar. The sleeves should end right where your thumb meets your wrist, and the body should lightly drape your torso without billowing out at the waist.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00088",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[88]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 7492,
      "endIndex": 7493,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00089",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[89]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 7493,
      "endIndex": 7524,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "5. Are your shirts pre-shrunk?",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00090",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[90]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
